                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5ee1ac37-fa42-3508-a24e-93b2624898db",
                        "entry_id": "fa4c216c-c18c-31dd-8246-4e137f6c2d4e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Émanciper, libérer de contrainte, rendre autonome, responsabiliser."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "neologism",
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ebf8be89-c96e-4afe-8a4f-b73f8ad480ce",
                                "sense_id": "5ee1ac37-fa42-3508-a24e-93b2624898db",
                                "text": "Pour le troisième groupe, on pourrait retenir l’importance cruciale de l’aptitude à faciliter la transition vers une perception de l’organisation comme système d’apprentissage, la capacité d’« empouvoirer » et de réellement responsabiliser les personnes, une culture de productivité, de souplesse, de créativité, une culture d’apprentissage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec02bedc-ccec-41be-9b74-52ed972a663c",
                                "sense_id": "5ee1ac37-fa42-3508-a24e-93b2624898db",
                                "text": "S’imaginer qu’on peut prédire son avenir, d’une certaine manière, ça rassure, ça empouvoire : on sait quelque chose que personne d’autre ne sait."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1520fe2d-9227-460d-8d19-2368ce0aa5aa",
                                "sense_id": "5ee1ac37-fa42-3508-a24e-93b2624898db",
                                "text": "J’admire l’engagement de L’Oréal Paris d’empouvoirer les femmes."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "df4810d0-79a8-3314-a7c5-13e08ebe150c",
                        "entry_id": "fa4c216c-c18c-31dd-8246-4e137f6c2d4e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "S’émanciper."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "pronominal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a33b53b-0f62-4115-b6a2-cb7222c10bd6",
                                "sense_id": "df4810d0-79a8-3314-a7c5-13e08ebe150c",
                                "text": "Sur les sites américains, on a droit toutes les semaines à des conseils adressés aux femmes pour lutter contre le syndrome de l’impostrice, des astuces afin de s’empouvoirer (sur le principe de l’empowerement)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "823bbaea-4583-4891-8de5-f6991c4fdc28",
                                "sense_id": "df4810d0-79a8-3314-a7c5-13e08ebe150c",
                                "text": "Une petite séance de twerk pour, je cite les propos des organisatrices rapportés par Cécile Bouanchaud du Monde : “montrer que ce n’est pas une danse de putes mais une façon de se réapproprier son corps et de s’empouvoirer“."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0669627e-b355-4916-ba6e-e1595aac0989",
                        "source_entry_id": "fa4c216c-c18c-31dd-8246-4e137f6c2d4e",
                        "target_lang_word": "empower",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "empower",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42d96ee9-ede6-3dfe-b504-0ce837a6246b",
                                        "entry_id": "9285936d-a309-3300-a514-8b5e6836b68c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To give permission, power, or the legal right to do something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1cf2411-c64e-4667-9429-1827bb87018f",
                                                "sense_id": "42d96ee9-ede6-3dfe-b504-0ce837a6246b",
                                                "text": "Regulations have been made under the Civil Aviation Acts of 1949, 1980 and 1982 which empower Inspectors of Accidents to do these things."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8da716d3-aac2-406d-81df-4c3d8f7a9b23",
                                                "sense_id": "42d96ee9-ede6-3dfe-b504-0ce837a6246b",
                                                "text": "Once on site, inspectors are empowered to exercise wide-ranging legal powers - including the right to enter railway property or land adjoining it; to make written, electronic or photographic records; to seize equipment, remove or retain samples; and to be given access to records and recording equipment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d38067c-4019-3cc8-b9de-60a8bbc1efb5",
                                        "entry_id": "9285936d-a309-3300-a514-8b5e6836b68c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To give someone more confidence and/or strength to do something, often by enabling them to increase their control over their own life or situation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7e0230b-90ff-4a0f-9776-aba4231a760d",
                                                "sense_id": "1d38067c-4019-3cc8-b9de-60a8bbc1efb5",
                                                "text": "John found that starting up his own business empowered him greatly in social situations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e934e1b-210f-4156-aac3-7ac02a73de24",
                                                "sense_id": "1d38067c-4019-3cc8-b9de-60a8bbc1efb5",
                                                "text": "Musically, what originally attracted me to dance was its shamanist aspects, using natural magic to change people's neurological states and to psychologically empower them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22f0c829-e1b0-4de9-9230-fc2eb05d2e64",
                                                "sense_id": "1d38067c-4019-3cc8-b9de-60a8bbc1efb5",
                                                "text": "This side of the training is effective in empowering employees to make better decisions on site, and helps to improve employee retention."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
